       "blocks": [
        {
         "id": "b_2h2vmjl9",
         "type": "text",
         "props": {
          "html": "<p>The practical bit: board at Oban from four, sail at six. Trains from Glasgow arrive across the road and the long-stay car park takes a ticket for the week. Ashore is by gangway where the quay allows and by tender where it does not, announced honestly; Freya is a ship of stairs. Travel insurance is a condition of booking.</p>"
         }
        }
       ]
